# taf.ul.moler.converter

[![Documentation](https://docs.taf.ute.nsn-rdnet.net/projects/taf-ul-moler-converter/badge/)][1]
[![Requirements](https://taf.wrgitlab-pages.int.net.nokia.com/miscellaneous/static-badges/requirements.svg)](requirements/base.txt)
[![build status](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/taf.ul.moler.converter/badges/main/pipeline.svg)][2]
[![coverage report](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/taf.ul.moler.converter/badges/main/coverage.svg)][2]
[![latest release](https://wrgitlab.int.net.nokia.com/TAF/taf.ul.moler.converter/-/badges/release.svg)][3]


taf.ul.moler.converter library



## Supported Python versions

Library should work properly with Python versions specified within
`python_requires` option in [setup.py](setup.py).

## Installation

Generic library installation process is described in [TAF user guide][4].

## Overview
The **taf.ul.moler.converter** library generates default configuration for moler devices based on defined testline configuration `__init__.py` (`tl` variable)

>__Legend__
>
> ~~Strikethrough~~ means that the device name is deprecated and should not be used anymore.


Regex | Example | Description | Moler device class
:--- | :--- | :--- | :---
UnixLocal | UnixLocal | Unix terminal on the machine where test is running | moler.device.unixlocal.UnixLocal
~~GNB\d+~~<br>~~GNB\d+_DU\d+~~<br>GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+<br>GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_LMP | ~~GNB0~~<br>~~GNB0_DU0~~<br>GNB0_DU0_CU0<br>GNB0_DU0_CU0_LMP | SSH connection to gNB lmp(eg ASIK) - via gNB workstation | ta_moler.device.air_scale.AirScale
GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_CPTY\d+ | GNB0_DU0_CU0_CPTY0<br>GNB0_DU0_CU0_CPTY1 | SSH connection to gNB Capacity Unit(eg ABIL) - via gNB workstation --> gNB lmp | ta_moler.device.air_scale.AirScale
~~GNB\d+_SYSLOG~~<br>GNB\d+_DU\d+_SYSLOG | ~~GNB0_SYSLOG~~<br>GNB0_DU0_SYSLOG | Connection for streaming syslog from GNB(streaming via nc) | ta_moler.device.unix_syslog.UnixSyslog
~~GNB\d+_WS~~<br>GNB\d+_DU\d+_WS | ~~GNB0_WS~~<br>GNB0_DU0_WS | SSH Connection to Workstation for gNB - usually UTE VM | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote
GNB\d+_ASIMGR | GNB0_ASIMGR<br>Deprecated - deleted in next release | SSH Connection to gNB Workstation(Here ASIR manager is installed)<br>Generated only in TL with ASIR | ta_moler.device.asi_mgr.AsiMgr
GNB\d+_HUB\d+ | GNB0_HUB0<br>Deprecated - deleted in next release | SSH connection to HUB via HUB Workstation<br>Generated only in TL with ASIR | ta_moler.device.hub.Hub
GNB\d+_HUB\d+_WS | GNB0_HUB0_WS<br>Deprecated - deleted in next release | SSH connection to Workstation for HUB<br>Generated only in TL with ASIR | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote
GNB\d+_CU | GNB1_CU | SSH connection to CU (Centralized Unit)<br>Generated only for CloudBts | ta_moler.device.cloud_bts.CloudBts
GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_RU\d+<br>GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_CPTY\d+_RU\d+ | GNB0_DU0_CU0_RU0<br>GNB1_DU0_CU0_CPTY0_RU2 | SSH Connection to RU(Radio Unit) via BTS | ta_moler.device.ru.RadioUnit
GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_RU\d+_LMP<br>GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_CPTY\d+_RU\d+_LMP | GNB0_DU0_CU0_RU0_LMP<br>GNB1_DU0_CU0_CPTY0_RU2_LMP | SSH Connection to RU(Radio Unit) via LMP(only for HUB and if defined lmp_connection in RU) | ta_moler.device.ru.RadioUnit
GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_RU\d+_CONSOLE<br>GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_CPTY\d+_RU\d+_CONSOLE | GNB0_DU0_CU0_RU0_CONSOLE<br>GNB1_DU0_CU0_CPTY0_RU2_CONSOLE | Telnet Connection to RU(Radio Unit) via TTY server(if defined default_telnet_connection_details in RU) | ta_moler.device.ru.RadioUnit
GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_RU\d+_WS<br>GNB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_CPTY\d+_RU\d+_WS | GNB0_DU0_CU0_RU0_WS<br>GNB1_DU0_CU0_CPTY0_RU2_WS | SSH Connection to RU Workstation(only for HUB and if defined lmp_connection in RU) | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote
~~ENB\d+~~<br>ENB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+<br>ENB\d+_DU\d+_CU\d+_LMP | ~~ENB0~~<br>ENB0_DU0_CU0<br>ENB0_DU0_CU0_LMP | SSH Connection to eNB - via eNB Workstation | ta_moler.device.air_scale.AirScale
~~ENB\d+_SYSLOG~~<br>ENB\d+_DU\d+_SYSLOG | GNB0_SYSLOG<br>GNB0_DU0_SYSLOG | Connection for streaming syslog from eNB(streaming via nc) | ta_moler.device.unix_syslog.UnixSyslog
~~ENB\d+_WS~~<br>ENB\d+_DU\d+_WS | ENB0_WS<br>ENB0_DU0_WS | SSH Connection to Workstation for eNB | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote
ENB\d+_HUB\d+ | ENB0_HUB0 | SSH connection to HUB via HUB Workstation<br>Generated only in TL with ASIR | ta_moler.device.hub.Hub
ENB\d+_HUB\d+_WS | ENB0_HUB0_WS<br>Deprecated - deleted in next release | SSH connection to Workstation for HUB<br>Generated only in TL with ASIR | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote
ENB\d+_ASIMGR | ENB0_ASIMGR<br>Deprecated - deleted in next release | SSH Connection to gNB Workstation(Here ASIR manager is installed)<br>Generated only in TL with ASIR | ta_moler.device.asi_mgr.AsiMgr
TEST_PC | TEST_PC | Main virtual machine from which test is running | ta_moler.device.ute_linux_remote.UteLinuxRemote
EPCSIM | EPCSIM | Telnet Connection to Egate | ta_moler.device.epcsim.EPCSim
EPCSIM_WS | EPCSIM_WS | SSH Connection to Workstation where EPCSIM is running | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote
APP_SERVER\d+<br>APP_SERVER\d+_\d+ | APP_SERVER0<br>APP_SERVER0_0 | SSH Connection to Application server | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote
UE\d+_PC | UE0_PC | SSH Connection to UE Control PC | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote
UE\d+_AT | UE0_AT | Serial Connection to UE | moler.device.atremote.AtRemote
NOM | NOM | SSH connection to NOM(Nokia Operation Masters) | moler.device.unixremote.UnixRemote

